		class PositionInfo {position[]={0,0,-6};};
		title="HALO and Static-Line Example (Minimal): the smallest working call - one passenger Blackfish with an explicitly placed BLUFOR pilot/copilot flies toward marker ""dz1"" with the default static-line jump action ready (300 m AGL / 300 km/h route, no HALO). No automatic createVehicleCrew call is used because the composition already contains its correctly sided crew. See the Halo And Static Line Paradrop Examples (Full) composition to see and edit every option, including a second HALO-configured aircraft. Wiki: https://github.com/AdamWaldie/WaldosMissionPack/wiki/Vehicle-Actions-&-Paradrop";
